0..70 Comment "//! This source refuses a bare constructor name that two imports bind."
71..74 Comment "//!"
75..154 Comment "//! `Light` and `Signal` come from two imports, and each declares `Red`. A bare"
155..181 Comment "//! use selects no import."
182..185 Comment "//!"
186..257 Comment "//! The bare use is refused `ImportShadows`, and the refusal names both"
258..328 Comment "//! imports. A use through its family names that family\'s constructor."
329..332 Comment "//!"
